OL,3,GNEWSAWhy drones are flying over
OL,4,AManchester railways
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice drones are being launched
OL,7,Fremotely over railway lines in
OL,8,FManchester as part of a scheme aimed at
OL,9,Ffinding trespassers and reducing
OL,10,Fdelays.
OL,12,FThe aircraft are kept in weatherproof
OL,13,Fboxes at sites beside the railway and
OL,14,Fcan be launched remotely by pilots
OL,15,Fbased in London when an incident is
OL,16,Freported.
OL,18,FSince the British Transport Police
OL,19,F(BTP) launched its first site in Leeds
OL,20,Fin April 2025, four sites have been
OL,21,Fintroduced across south London, as well
OL,22,Fas sites in Leicester and Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
